{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：10:57 2026-06-05 HKT</p>\n\n<p>黃大仙銀鳳街47號緯寶樓，今(5日）早上9時53分，一名13歲女童在家中鬧情緒，聲稱不開心欲跳樓，走上天台危站，警方及消防接報到場展開游說，終被勸服返回安全位置，被送往伊利沙伯醫院檢查。據了解，女童近日已沒有上學，情緒低落。</p>\n<p></p>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/55cfc761cad7d4ea999d359dd80990b8/2026-06/1_1_7.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"大批警員到場。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/032097d61de5567f7cb41cf8f7eea22f/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_10_42_36.jpeg\" title=\"大批警員到場。劉漢權攝\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場展開游說。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f75a962bf7d479281e7f5e8b9dd4df41/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_10_42_37_2_.jpeg\" title=\"警員到場展開游說。劉漢權攝\"/>\n<img alt=\"警員到場展開游說。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b2fa06c97b1bfe7f98bf991cc94d4fc4/2026-06/WhatsApp_Image_2026-06-05_at_10_42_37.jpeg\" title=\"警員到場展開游說。\"/>\n<p></p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-05T03:19:33.906154+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":138,"images":4,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"unknown"}}